liomielitis disebabkan oleh...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Poliovirus (enterovirus RNA), ditularkan fekal-oral","B":"Coxsackievirus, ditularkan melalui vektor nyamuk","C":"Rhabdovirus, ditularkan melalui gigitan hewan","D":"Poliovirus (virus DNA), ditularkan melalui droplet","E":"Retrovirus, ditularkan melalui kontak seksual"},"answer":"A","explanation":"Polio: RNA virus, enterovirus, fekal-oral; faktor risiko tidak divaksin, bayi, ibu hamil, immunocompromised.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q60","category":"","question":"Reseptor seluler tempat poliovirus menempel pada patogenesis adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"CD20","B":"CD155","C":"CD34","D":"CD4","E":"CD8"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Poliovirus menempel pada CD155, masuk lewat endositosis (viropexis), replikasi, viremia, lalu menginfeksi SSP.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q61","category":"","question":"Sebagian besar infeksi poliovirus (±95%) bermanifestasi sebagai...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Poliomielitis bulbospinal","B":"Poliomielitis nonparalitik","C":"Infeksi subklinis","D":"Poliomielitis paralitik spinal","E":"Poliomielitis bulbar"},"answer":"C","explanation":"Subklinis 95%, nonparalitik 1–2%, paralitik 0,1–0,5%.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q62","category":"","question":"Pada poliomielitis paralitik, bentuk yang paling sering adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Polio bulbospinal (79%)","B":"Polio bulbar (19%)","C":"Polio spinal (79%)","D":"Polio bulbar (79%)","E":"Polio spinal (19%)"},"answer":"C","explanation":"Spinal 79%, bulbospinal 19%, bulbar 2%.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q63","category":"","question":"Tatalaksana utama poliomielitis adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Artesunat intravena diikuti primakuin","B":"Seftriakson intravena dosis tinggi selama 2 minggu","C":"Vaksinasi sebagai pencegahan, serta terapi suportif dan fisioterapi","D":"Antipolio spesifik dos