nfeksi oportunistik SSP pada HIV: meningitis TB, toksoplasmosis, ensefalitis CMV, meningitis kriptokokus.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q75","category":"","question":"Pemeriksaan penunjang yang wajib dilakukan pada dugaan meningitis TB adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Angiografi serebral dan biopsi otak stereotaktik","B":"EEG dan elektromiografi saraf tepi","C":"Kultur darah dan sediaan darah tebal-tipis","D":"Tinta India LCS dan serologi Toxoplasma","E":"CT/MRI kontras, toraks PA, lab darah, dan tes HIV"},"answer":"E","explanation":"Penunjang: head CT/MRI kontras, toraks PA, lab darah, tes HIV; DD meningitis bakterial.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q76","category":"","question":"Regimen obat antituberkulosis pada meningitis TB menurut slide mencakup...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"INH, sulfadiazin, dan pirimetamin","B":"Etambutol, ganciclovir, dan foscarnet","C":"INH, rifampisin, etambutol, dan kortikosteroid","D":"Rifampisin, amfoterisin B, dan flukonazol","E":"INH, metronidazol, dan doksisiklin"},"answer":"C","explanation":"OAT: INH, rifampisin, etambutol (PAS, streptomisin), plus prednison; EVD/VP shunt bila hidrosefalus.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q77","category":"","question":"Tindakan operatif pada meningitis TB dengan hidrosefalus adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Trakeostomi","B":"Kraniotomi eksisi tuberkuloma pada semua kasus","C":"Tonsilektomi","D":"Pemasangan EVD atau VP shunt","E":"Laminektomi dekompresi"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Operatif: EVD atau VP shunt bila ada hidrosefalus.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q78","category":"","question":"Toksoplasmosis serebral pada pasien HIV terjadi karena...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Infeksi bakteri Toxoplasma gondii dari luka kulit","B":"Infeksi primer virus Toxoplasma gondii","C":"Penularan langsung dari pasien HIV lain lewat droplet","D":"Infeksi jamur Toxoplasma gondii dari inhalasi spora","E":"Reaktivasi kista laten Toxoplasma gondii di jaringan"},"answer":"E","explanation":"T. gondii adalah protozoa; toksoplasmosis serebral akibat reaktivasi kista laten.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q79","category":"","question":"Perhatikan MRI berikut pada pasien HIV dengan hemiparesis dan kejang. Lesi ring enhancing multipel paling sesuai dengan... ","questionImages":["images/packages/2h-persiapan-minites__infeksi-sistem-saraf/img-005.png"],"options":{"A":"Meningitis bakterial akut","B":"Toksoplasmosis serebral","C":"Ensefalitis herpes simpleks","D":"Mielitis transversa","E":"Infark serebri lakunar"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Lesi fokal/ring enhancing pada ODHA dengan defisit fokal progresif khas ensefalitis toksoplasma.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q80","category":"","question":"Diagnosis banding toksoplasmosis serebral pada HIV adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Ensefalitis HSV, mumps, dan Japanese ensefalitis","B":"Meningitis kriptokokus, malaria serebral, dan sepsis berat","C":"Progressive multifocal leukoencephalopathy, infeksi TB, dan limfoma SSP","D":"Tetanus, rabies, dan poliomielitis paralitik","E":"Mielitis transversa, ADEM, dan abses spinal epidural"},"answer":"C","explanation":"DD toksoplasmosis serebral: PML, infeksi TBC, limfoma SSP.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q81","category":"","question":"Diagnosis definitif ensefalitis toksoplasma ditegakkan dengan...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"IgG anti-Toxoplasma positif pada serum","B":"Histologi biopsi jaringan otak","C":"Nilai CD4 di bawah 200 sel/mm³","D":"Gambaran CT scan kepala dengan kontras","E":"Respons terapi empirik selama dua minggu"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Definitif: histologi biopsi otak; presumtif: respons terapi empirik klinis dan imajing.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q82","category":"","question":"Terapi empirik anti-toksoplasma TIDAK disarankan bila...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Serologi negatif tetapi lesi multipel progresif","B":"CD4 >200 sel/mm³","C":"Terdapat gejala neurologis fokal progresif","D":"Pasien HIV positif dengan lesi fokal pada imaging","E":"Pasien dengan lesi massa intrakranial dan CD4 <100"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Tidak disarankan bila CD4 >200, IgG anti-toksoplasma negatif, atau telah menerima profilaksis kotrimoksazol adekuat.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q83","category":"","question":"Kombinasi terapi ensefalitis toksoplasma yang dipakai di Indonesia karena sulfadiazin tidak tersedia adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Pirimetamin + sulfadiazin","B":"Pirimetamin + ganciclovir","C":"Klindamisin + foscarnet","D":"Kotrimoksazol + amfoterisin B","E":"Pirimetamin + klindamisin"},"answer":"E","explanation":"Standar: pirimetamin + sulfadiazin; di Indonesia pirimetamin + klindamisin.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q84","category":"","question":"Respons klinis terapi empirik anti-toksoplasma biasanya terlihat dalam...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"6 bulan","B":"1 hari","C":"7 hari","D":"3 bulan","E":"2 hari"},"answer":"C","explanation":"Respons klinik dalam 7 hari; respons radiologik mulai minggu ke-2; fase akut 4–6 minggu.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q85","category":"","question":"Gambaran EEG pada ensefalitis HSV adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Periodic high voltage spike wave dan slow wave complex di regio temporal","B":"Gelombang gergaji di vertex dengan frekuensi 2–5 Hz","C":"Sleep spindle 12–14 Hz di regio frontosentral secara periodik","D":"Gelombang delta difus tanpa periodisitas di semua regio","E":"Gelombang alfa dominan di regio oksipital saat mata tertutup"},"answer":"A","explanation":"EEG HSV: high voltage periodic spike wave dan kompleks slow wave di temporal.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q86","category":"","question":"Pemeriksaan LCS pada ensefalitis viral menunjukkan...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Pleositosis dominan sel mononuklear dan peningkatan protein","B":"Pleositosis dominan PMN dengan glukosa sangat rendah","C":"Kriptokokus pada pengecatan tinta India LCS","D":"Basil tahan asam pada pewarnaan Ziehl-Neelsen LCS","E":"Leukosit normal dengan protein LCS normal"},"answer":"A","explanation":"LCS ensefalitis viral: pleositosis mononuklear dan protein meningkat; PCR HSV, CMV, HHV-6.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q87","category":"","question":"Terapi ensefalitis HSV dengan dosis dan lama yang tepat adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Asiklovir 10 mg/kgBB tiap 8 jam selama 3 hari","B":"Ganciclovir 10 mg/kgBB tiap 8 jam selama 3 bulan","C":"Foscarnet 10 mg/kgBB tiap 24 jam selama 3 minggu","D":"Asiklovir 10 mg/kgBB tiap 8 jam selama 3 minggu","E":"Asiklovir 1 mg/kgBB tiap 24 jam selama 3 minggu"},"answer":"D","explanation":"HSV: asiklovir 10 mg/kg tiap 8 jam selama 3 minggu; resisten → foscarnet 60 mg/kg tiap 8 jam.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q88","category":"","question":"Terapi induksi pada dugaan ensefalitis CMV adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Doksisiklin tunggal selama 7 hari","B":"Pirimetamin + klindamisin selama 6 minggu","C":"Asiklovir tunggal selama 3 hari","D":"Ganciklovir + foscarnet selama 2–3 minggu","E":"Amfoterisin B + flukonazol selama 2 minggu"},"answer":"D","explanation":"CMV: induksi 2–3 minggu ganciklovir 5 mg/kg/12 jam + foscarnet 60 mg/kg/8 jam; lalu pemeliharaan.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q89","category":"","question":"Pada Rocky Mountain spotted fever dengan keterlibatan SSP, terapi yang diberikan adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Doksisiklin 100 mg tiap 12 jam","B":"Foscarnet 60 mg/kgBB tiap 8 jam","C":"Pirimetamin 200 mg loading","D":"Asiklovir 10 mg/kgBB tiap 8 jam","E":"Amfoterisin B 0,7 mg/kgBB/hari"},"answer":"A","explanation":"Rocky mountain fever: doksisiklin 100 mg/12 jam.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q90","category":"","question":"Agen penyebab meningitis pada pasien HIV yang didiagnosis dengan pengecatan tinta India adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Mycobacterium tuberculosis","B":"Cryptococcus neoformans","C":"Neisseria meningitidis","D":"Toxoplasma gondii","E":"Cytomegalovirus"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Kriptokokus ditemukan pada tinta India atau kultur C. neoformans.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q91","category":"","question":"Meningitis kriptokokus memiliki ciri klinis...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Onset hiperakut kurang dari 6 jam dengan kaku kuduk selalu jelas","B":"Prodromal 2–4 minggu, tanda meningitis klasik tidak selalu ada, dan TIK meningkat","C":"Kelemahan tungkai dengan batas sensibilitas jelas","D":"Trismus dan opistotonus dengan kesadaran tetap baik","E":"Hidrofobia, hipersalivasi, dan kontraksi otot faring"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Prodromal 2–4 minggu, demam, sakit kepala, tanda klasik meningitis tidak selalu dijumpai, TIK meningkat, gangguan kognitif.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q92","category":"","question":"Terapi induksi meningitis kriptokokus (minggu 1–2) adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Amfoterisin B + flukonazol 800 mg/hari","B":"Ampisilin + seftriakson selama 2 minggu","C":"Ganciklovir + foscarnet selama 3 minggu","D":"INH + rifampisin + etambutol selama 2 minggu","E":"Pirimetamin + klindamisin selama 6 minggu"},"answer":"A","explanation":"Induksi: amfoterisin B 0,7–1 mg/kgBB/hari + flukonazol 800 mg/hari; konsolidasi minggu 3–10: flukonazol 800 mg/hari.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q93","category":"","question":"Terapi konsolidasi meningitis kriptokokus pada minggu 3–10 adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Asiklovir 10 mg/kgBB tiap 8 jam","B":"Flukonazol 800 mg/hari per oral","C":"Ganciklovir 5 mg/kgBB tiap 12 jam","D":"Rifampisin 600 mg/hari","E":"Amfoterisin B 1 mg/kgBB/hari IV"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Konsolidasi minggu 3–10: flukonazol 800 mg/hari PO.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false},{"id":"Q94","category":"","question":"Karakteristik virus SARS-CoV-2 penyebab COVID-19 adalah...","questionImages":[],"options":{"A":"Virus tanpa selubung dengan genom RNA untai negatif","B":"Bakteri gram negatif dengan genom sirkular kecil","C":"Virus berselubung dengan genom DNA untai tunggal","D":"Virus tanpa selubung dengan genom DNA untai ganda","E":"Virus berselubung dengan genom RNA untai tunggal positif"},"answer":"E","explanation":"Coronavirus: enveloped, positive sense single-stranded RNA.","explanationImages":[],"isBroken":false}]}
